  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p id=\"isPasted\">unbound was founded in London, in October 2025 by two friends, Iona Gaynor and Anita Toulmin.&nbsp;</p><p>We’re not reinventing the wheel with our dumbbells; but we are making it work better for women. Of course we can lift the dumbbells that are out there, but the grip can be slippy and uncomfortable and the ends are bulky and awkward to train with. They don't feel good in our hands and they look ugly in our homes. We've designed dumbbells with women in mind from the start, not as an afterthought.&nbsp;</p><p id=\"isPasted\"><strong>unbound dumbbells features:</strong></p><p>1. Sweat-resistant rubber coated handle for comfort and maximum grip strength&nbsp;</p><p>2. Handle width optimised for women's hand size</p><p>3. Steel skeleton wrapped in anti-vibration rubber to protect your floors and your skin</p><p>4. Traditionally hex-shaped for stability, function and anti-roll</p><p>5. Beautifully designed to live out in the open</p><p>We’ve tested and retested, we’ve shared with experts in the field, and we can confidently say this is the best dumbbell out there.</p><p>We want every women in the UK to be strength training because we know the importance to bone, muscle and hear health. The science all points towards the importance for women of training but the gyms are often intimidating and daunting. That's why unbound is here to support women on their journey to becoming stronger.&nbsp;</p><p>We would like to offer 5% for every product sold through affiliate link and we will also offer a 15% discount if we approve your application. We are looking for PT or people within the fitness industry who are also on a mission to make women feel empowered and strong.</p></div>",
